# Backend quality

**Spec:** [docs/architecture/backend-quality.md](../../docs/architecture/backend-quality.md)

## Before merge (Go)

1. `cd backend && make check-layout` — repository whitelist, `pkg/` kebab-case, Postgres mocks present.
2. `cd backend/<module> && make check` — fmt, lint, tests, **scoped** `test-cover` vs `.coverage-min` (target **90%**).
3. New `pg_repository.go` → add `repository/mock/pg_repository_mock.go` in the same slice (Redis: miniredis only).
4. Proto mappers live in `pkg/auth-pb/` (`authPb`), not generic `pkg/converter/`.

## Ratchet

When adding tests, raise the module's `.coverage-min` toward 90 — do not lower floors.
